Tue Oct 20 00:11:20 UTC 2026 - Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>

- version 1.3.1-0
- Stop shipping libghostty-vt.{so,pc} + /usr/include/ghostty: Tumbleweed
  now ships libghostty-vt0/ghostty-devel/terminfo-ghostty 1.3.1-2.2 from
  Factory (checked 2026-10-20), /usr/bin/ghostty does not link or dlopen
  the lib (readelf NEEDED + strings: no libghostty-vt), so our copy was a
  same-SONAME shadow of the distro package (owner no-repackage rule).
  Require the distro terminfo-ghostty instead: ncurses-term has no
  xterm-ghostty entry (infocmp in clean TW container). Fixes all 15
  rpmlint E: (13 devel-file-in-non-devel-package + 2 library-without-
  ldconfig); branding-requires-unversioned suppressed via new
  ghostty-rpmlintrc (repo convention). Debian recipe unchanged: Debian
  testing/sid ship NO ghostty/libghostty package (Packages.gz verified),
  so the .dsc keeps bundling lib + headers + terminfo.

